Review: Constructors 
• Method that is called when an instance is created 

class Integer { 
public: 
  int val; 
  Integer() { 
    val = 0; cout << "default constructor" << endl; 
  } 
}; 

int main() { 
  Integer i; 
} 

Output: 
default constructor

• When making an array of objects, default 
constructor is invoked on each 
class Integer { 
public: 
  int val; 
  Integer() { 
    val = 0; cout << "default constructor" << endl; 
  } 
}; 

int main() { 
